silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_04_history_and_path_admission_sections_02_path_admission_predicate_unpacking_concrete_anchor_15_m11apex#m_11_apex silm:hasLongDescription "The m_11_apex is the page-11 colimit apex m_11 = colim D_Mittens_11; identified with Mittens iff cocone legs compatible. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'm_11_apex', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
